    "page": 3,
    "fullText": "A B O U T   U S :  03  The Timber Lights was founded with a clear vision — to create statement pendant lighting that feels  architectural, timeless, and uncompromising in quality.  By combining material craftsmanship with advanced lighting technology, we have developed  refined wooden pendant systems that integrate seamlessly into sophisticated environments.  Each piece reflects our commitment to:  • Clean, disciplined design  • Premium, carefully selected materials  • Precision engineering and detailing  • Warm, balanced illumination  Lighting is not an accessory.  It is an architectural focal point.",
